      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Martinez%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "A 1877 railroad bridge linked Martinez to the Transcontinental Line, turning the town into a key transfer point between the Shasta and Coastal routes.",
